# Pin the Conexant CX93001 USB modem (KALEA 56K) to a stable /dev name, so the
# daemon never has to guess a ttyACM number. Needed when other cdc_acm devices
# (ttyACM*) share the Pi, since enumeration order is not stable across reboots.
# Match by USB VID:PID.
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="0572", ATTRS{idProduct}=="1340", SYMLINK+="dreampi-modem"
